          }
        }
      ],
      "paragraphStyle": {
        "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
        "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT"
      }
    },
    {
      "elements": [
        {
          "startIndex": 1948,
          "endIndex": 2106,
          "textRun": {
            "content": "Across every category, Pass@1 increases with scale. Gains are particularly substantial in reasoning and knowledge. The same is not true for Pass@8, however. \n",
            "textStyle": {}
          }
        }
      ],
      "paragraphStyle": {
        "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
        "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT"
      }
    },
    {
      "elements": [
        {
          "startIndex": 2106,
          "endIndex": 2107,
          "inlineObjectElement": {
            "inlineObjectId": "kix.bivcug1ekzwq",
            "textStyle": {}
          }
        },
        {
          "startIndex": 2107,
          "endIndex": 2108,
          "textRun": {
            "content": "\n",
            "textStyle": {}
          }
        }
      ],
      "paragraphStyle": {
        "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
        "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT"
      }
    },
    {
      "elements": [
        {
          "startIndex": 2108,
          "endIndex": 2109,
          "textRun": {
            "content": "\n",
            "textStyle": {}
          }
        }
      ],
      "paragraphStyle": {
        "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
        "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT"
      }
    },
    {
      "elements": [
        {
          "startIndex": 2109,
          "endIndex": 2110,
          "textRun": {
            "content": "\n",
            "textStyle": {}
          }
        }
      ],
      "paragraphStyle": {
        "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
        "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT"
      }
    },
    {
      "elements": [
        {
          "startIndex": 2110,
          "endIndex": 2275,
          "textRun": {
            "content": "In some cases, the largest model has the lowest coverage. Therefore, scale helps with reliability but doesn’t necessarily enable the model to solve “new” problems. \n",
            "textStyle": {}
          }
        }
      ],
      "paragraphStyle": {
        "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
        "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT"
      }
    },
    {
      "elements": [
        {
          "startIndex": 2275,
          "endIndex": 2276,
          "textRun": {
            "content": "\n",
            "textStyle": {}
          }
        }
      ],
      "paragraphStyle": {
        "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
        "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT"
      }
    },
    {
      "elements": [
        {
          "startIndex": 2276,
          "endIndex": 2322,
          "textRun": {
            "content": "When Is Scaffolding Useful? When Does It Hurt?",
            "textStyle": {}
          }
        },
        {
          "startIndex": 2322,
          "endIndex": 2323,
          "textRun": {
            "content": "\n",
            "textStyle": {}
          }
        }
      ],
      "paragraphStyle": {
        "headingId": "h.uiu5qrldlbf1",
        "namedStyleType": "SUBTITLE",
        "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT"
      }
    },
    {
      "elements": [
        {
          "startIndex": 2323,
          "endIndex": 2566,
          "textRun": {
            "content": "To see where harness changes can improve VLM performance, we measure the performance of Qwen-3.6 27B in the Codex harness across eight rollouts, allowing it to analyze images programmatically using Python, with Pillow and NumPy preinstalled. \n",
            "textStyle": {}
          }
        }
      ],
      "paragraphStyle": {
        "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
        "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT"
      }
    },
    {
      "elements": [
        {
          "startIndex": 2566,
          "endIndex": 2567,
          "textRun": {
            "content": "\n",
            "textStyle": {}
          }
        }
      ],
      "paragraphStyle": {
        "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
        "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT"
      }
    },
    {
      "elements": [
        {
          "startIndex": 2567,
          "endIndex": 2568,
          "textRun": {
            "content": "\n",
            "textStyle": {}
          }
        }
      ],
      "paragraphStyle": {
        "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
        "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT"
      }
    },
    {
      "elements": [
        {
          "startIndex": 2568,
          "endIndex": 2569,
          "inlineObjectElement": {
            "inlineObjectId": "kix.54z9fnwapje3",
            "textStyle": {}
          }
        },
        {
          "startIndex": 2569,
          "endIndex": 2570,
          "textRun": {
            "content": "\n",
            "textStyle": {}
          }
        }
      ],
      "paragraphStyle": {
        "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
        "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT"
      }
    },
    {
      "elements": [
        {
          "startIndex": 2570,
          "endIndex": 2571,
          "textRun": {
            "content": "\n",
            "textStyle": {}
          }
        }
      ],
      "paragraphStyle": {
        "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
        "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT"
      }
    },
    {
      "elements": [
        {
          "startIndex": 2571,
          "endIndex": 2752,
          "textRun": {
            "content": "Looking at the distribution of problems solved, we see that the number of questions solved at least once (Pass@8) increases. This suggests that the harness allows us to improve the ",
            "textStyle": {}
          }
        },
        {
          "startIndex": 2752,
          "endIndex": 2760,
          "textRun": {
            "content": "coverage",
            "textStyle": {
              "italic": true
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "startIndex": 2760,
          "endIndex": 2794,
          "textRun": {
            "content": " of the base Qwen-3.6 27B model. \n",
            "textStyle": {}
          }
        }
      ],
      "paragraphStyle": {
        "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
        "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT"
      }
    },
    {
      "elements": [
        {
          "startIndex": 2794,
          "endIndex": 2795,
          "textRun": {
            "content": "\n",
            "textStyle": {}
          }
        }
      ],
      "paragraphStyle": {
        "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
        "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT"
      }
    },
    {
      "elements": [
        {
          "startIndex": 2795,
          "endIndex": 2796,
          "inlineObjectElement": {
            "inlineObjectId": "kix.gyy0ewwv8oru",
            "textStyle": {}
          }
        },
        {
          "startIndex": 2796,
          "endIndex": 2797,
          "textRun": {
            "content": "\n",
            "textStyle": {}
          }
        }
      ],
      "paragraphStyle": {
        "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
        "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT"
      }
    },
    {
      "elements": [
        {
          "startIndex": 2797,
          "endIndex": 2798,
          "textRun": {
            "content": "\n",
            "textStyle": {}
          }
        }
      ],
      "paragraphStyle": {
        "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
        "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT"
      }
    },
    {
      "elements": [
        {
          "startIndex": 2798,
          "endIndex": 2930,
          "textRun": {
            "content": "However, the variance across rollouts also increases – the number of problems solved successfully in all eight rollouts goes down. \n",
            "textStyle": {}
          }
        }
      ],
      "paragraphStyle": {
        "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
        "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT"
      }
